## Project Title
CampusLink Market

## Platform Used
Wix

## Project Description
CampusLink Market is a student-focused e-commerce website designed to enable university students to buy and sell campus essentials such as books, electronics, clothing, stationery, and other everyday items. The website provides a simple and user-friendly shopping experience.

## Features Implemented
- Homepage with welcome message and featured products
- Product page with product images, names, prices, and descriptions
- About page describing the business
- Contact page with contact information and contact form
- Shopping cart functionality
- Responsive and user-friendly interface

